{"out": "../../../output/cant-let-go-draft/part5.mp4", "audio": "p5.wav", "speed": 1.0, "tail": 0.45, "music_fade": 0.5, "music_cues": [{"shot": 0, "music": "../../../../reels/audio/music/echoes.mp3", "start": 100.0}, {"shot": 14, "music": "../../../../reels/audio/music/silent-descent.mp3", "start": 30.0}], "music_volume": 0.33, "style": {"grade": "night", "captions": "underline", "caption_y": 0.86, "vignette": 0.5, "grain": 4}, "shots": [{"text": "The second thing is the fantasy.", "v": {"mg": "marker", "lines": ["#2", "THE FANTASY"], "mark": ["THE FANTASY"], "times": [0.0, "@fantasy"]}, "captions": false}, {"text": "When someone leaves, our mind edits the movie.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-movie-edit.jpg", "focus": [0.4, 0.5], "zoom": 1.0, "to_zoom": 1.4, "drift": 0}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "It cuts out the arguments, the times they didn't reply, the way you never quite felt secure.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-movie-edit.jpg", "focus": [0.45, 0.9], "zoom": 2.0}, "sfx": [{"name": "scratch", "at": "@cuts"}], "in": "cut"}, {"text": "And it keeps the highlights. The best night, the best kiss, the best conversation.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/sad-woman-3.mp4", "start": 6.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "zoom", "sfx": [{"name": "sweep", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "So you're not actually missing them.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["YOU'RE NOT", "white"], ["MISSING THEM.", "white"]], "times": [0.0, "@missing"]}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "You're missing a trailer your brain put together.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-trailer.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.5], "zoom": 1.0, "to": [0.55, 0.35], "to_zoom": 1.5, "drift": 0}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "And nobody can compete with a trailer.", "v": {"mg": "marker", "lines": ["NOBODY CAN", "COMPETE WITH", "A TRAILER"], "mark": ["A TRAILER"], "times": [0.0, "@compete", "@trailer"]}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "Not the next person you date, and honestly, not even the real version of them.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/sad-woman-6.mp4", "start": 6.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "A friend of mine gave me a weird piece of advice that worked.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/friends-talking-5.mp4", "start": 6.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "pause_before": 0.25, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "She said, write down every single time she made you feel small, anxious, or ignored. Every one.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/writing-letter-1.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "I thought it was petty.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["PETTY?", "white"]], "times": [0.0]}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "But when I read that list a week later,", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-list.jpg", "focus": [0.55, 0.5], "zoom": 1.0, "to_zoom": 1.4, "drift": 0}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "I realised I'd spent most of those three months waiting for a text.", "v": {"mg": "chat", "messages": [["hey :)", "me", -1.0], ["you there?", "me", 0.3]], "title": "Lena", "status": "Delivered", "status_at": "@waiting"}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "The relationship I was grieving mostly existed in my head.", "v": {"mg": "quote", "text": "The relationship I was grieving mostly existed in my head.", "end": "@head", "width": 30}, "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "The third thing is the most painful one to admit.", "v": {"mg": "marker", "lines": ["#3", "HOLDING ON"], "mark": ["HOLDING ON"], "times": [0.0, "@painful"]}, "pause_before": 0.25, "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "Sometimes we hold on because letting go means admitting it's really over.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-candle.jpg", "focus": [0.55, 0.45], "zoom": 1.0, "to_zoom": 1.4, "drift": 0}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "As long as you're still thinking about them, there's a tiny part of you that believes it might still happen.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/insomnia-2.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "zoom", "sfx": [{"name": "sweep", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "The thinking feels like hope.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["THE THINKING", "white"], ["FEELS LIKE HOPE.", "yellow"]], "times": [0.0, "@feels"]}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "And giving it up feels like losing them a second time.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-candle.jpg", "focus": [0.57, 0.4], "zoom": 1.8}, "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}, {"name": "heartbeat", "at": "@second"}], "in": "blur"}]}